Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d59abac-e301-38fa-8660-396f412429f5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
